{
  "id": "402",
  "title": "Your Dog Has Been Found",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2017-11-18",
  "synopsis": "Ben and Lili return the dog Jack to its owner Aunt Li.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/577/66b98cbe7ea914f3d0378c2c031a1139c3cde71b.mp3?1554973242",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 2: Lili’s Boyfriend",
    "chapter": 20,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你的狗找到了\n\n本：李阿姨，你的狗找到了！\n李阿姨：真的吗？在哪儿？\n本：在这儿。你看看，它是杰克吗？\n李阿姨：对！它就是我的狗—杰克！本，太谢谢你了！\n本：啊，不是我找到的，是我的朋友丽丽找到的。\n李阿姨：丽丽，谢谢你啊！\n丽丽：不客气！",
    "traditional": "你的狗找到了\n\n本：李阿姨，你的狗找到了！\n李阿姨：真的嗎？在哪兒？\n本：在這兒。你看看，它是傑克嗎？\n李阿姨：對！它就是我的狗—傑克！本，太謝謝你了！\n本：啊，不是我找到的，是我的朋友麗麗找到的。\n李阿姨：麗麗，謝謝你啊！\n麗麗：不客氣！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Your Dog Has Been Found"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：李阿姨，你的狗找到了！",
      "traditional": "本：李阿姨，你的狗找到了！",
      "pinyin": "běn lǐ ā yí nǐ de gǒu zhǎo dào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Aunt Li, your dog has been found!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "李阿姨：真的吗？在哪儿？",
      "traditional": "李阿姨：真的嗎？在哪兒？",
      "pinyin": "lǐ ā yí zhēn de ma zài nǎ'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Aunt Li: Really? Where is he?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：在这儿。你看看，它是杰克吗？",
      "traditional": "本：在這兒。你看看，它是傑克嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn zài zhè‘r nǐ kàn kan tā shì jié kè ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: He's here. Look, isn't this Jack?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "李阿姨：对！它就是我的狗—杰克！本，太谢谢你了！",
      "traditional": "李阿姨：對！它就是我的狗—傑克！本，太謝謝你了！",
      "pinyin": "lǐ ā yí duì tā jiù shì wǒ de gǒu jié kè běn tài xiè xie nǐ le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Aunt Li: Yes! That's my dog – Jack! Ben, thank you so much!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：啊，不是我找到的，是我的朋友丽丽找到的。",
      "traditional": "本：啊，不是我找到的，是我的朋友麗麗找到的。",
      "pinyin": "běn a bú shì wǒ zhǎo dào de shì wǒ de péng you lì lì zhǎo dào de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ah, it wasn't me who found him, it was my friend Lili."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "李阿姨：丽丽，谢谢你啊！",
      "traditional": "李阿姨：麗麗，謝謝你啊！",
      "pinyin": "lǐ ā yí lì lì xiè xie nǐ a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Aunt Li: Lili, thank you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：不客气！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：不客氣！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì bú kè qi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Don't mention it!"
    }
  ],
